        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Philip Glass, Franz Schreker, Tim Fain\n- Works: Irrelohe, Black Swan\n- Roles: composer, conductor, teacher, administrator, violinist\n\nFacts:\n- Franz Schreker was born on 23 March 1878 in Monaco and died on 21 March 1934 in Berlin.\n- Philip Glass was born on January 31, 1937 and is an American composer.\n- Franz Schreker was an Austrian composer, conductor, teacher, and administrator.\n- Tim Fain is an American violinist.\n- Tim Fain is perhaps best known for his performances in the movie Black Swan and for his work with American composer Philip Glass.\n- Irrelohe is an opera in three acts by Austrian composer Franz Schreker, and Franz Schreker also wrote its libretto.",
